      <h2>What Nexus does not do</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="v3-cards v3-cards--3">
      <div class="v3-card">
        <div class="v3-card__num">01</div>
        <h3>Wholesale and B2B invoicing</h3>
        <p>If your wholesale accounts and invoices live somewhere else, they stay there. We are the retail counter and the customer side, not your B2B ledger.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-card">
        <div class="v3-card__num">02</div>
        <h3>Time-scheduled menus</h3>
        <p>If your menu changes from cafe to bar at a set hour, today that is a manual switch on the tablet, not an automatic one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="v3-card">
        <div class="v3-card__num">03</div>
        <h3>Member limits, honestly</h3>
        <p>The 5,000-member ceiling on Loyalty Standard is checked by hand at renewal, not metered live in the product. We would rather write that here than have you discover it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

